# --- El Colombiano: version the tuned math outputs ---
# The upstream rules above exclude every games/*/library/ artifact. For
# el_colombiano we keep the outputs needed to reproduce the tuned 96.70% RTP
# without re-running the simulation. Still excluded: optimization_files/
# (optimizer intermediates), forces/ (force records), and publish_files/
# (byte-identical to upload/math/).
!games/el_colombiano/library/
!games/el_colombiano/library/*.json
!games/el_colombiano/library/*.xlsx
!games/el_colombiano/library/lookup_tables/
!games/el_colombiano/library/lookup_tables/**
!games/el_colombiano/library/books/
!games/el_colombiano/library/books/**
!games/el_colombiano/library/configs/
!games/el_colombiano/library/configs/**
